+# ---- streamed draft-expert load (DSpark heads) ----------------------------
+# A separate draft model (DSpark head) re-creates FULL MoE decoder layers
+# NEXT TO the fully-loaded target model. The stock create path allocates
+# every draft layer's packed-mxfp4 expert params on the GPU up front
