+# checkpoint byte is read — measured as the difference between a booting
+# drafter and an OOM on tight cards (2x OOM on a 96 GiB card with resident
+# planes; a 32 GiB card cannot host the up-front staging next to serving
+# allocations at all). Stream instead: stage the big expert params in host
+# RAM at create time, count each layer's expected (expert, shard) loads
