+
+    DSpark extends DFlash with a Markov logit-bias head, reusing the same
+    Qwen3DSparkModel loader and DSparkSpeculator runtime as the dense DSpark
+    checkpoints (e.g. deepseek-ai/dspark_qwen3_8b_block7).
