+    ) -> tuple[torch.Tensor, list[torch.Tensor] | None]:
+        """moe_w2 MANDATORY base-cache replay — V2 port of the V1 inline
+        TP path (gpu_model_runner.py).
+
+        With VLLM_MOE_W2_BASE_CACHE_GB the 2-bit base is host-resident and
+        the GPU pool may MISS routed experts — the desc kernel zeroed their
+        contributions and bumped the tier's in-graph miss counter (the
+        counter is zeroed at every forward's start, so it always reflects
+        the LAST pass). Fetch the missing experts synchronously on every
+        rank (consensus) and replay the step to a bounded FIXED POINT:
+        corrected early layers can re-route later layers onto experts the
+        first pass never fetched. Runs BEFORE the optional confidence gate,
+        mirroring the V1 order. Unlike the gate this is NOT fail-safe: any
+        failure is fatal, because returning zero-contribution hidden
+        states is silent model corruption.
+
+        Speculative drafts (DSpark) run AFTER this safe point; a draft
+        pass's misses zero contributions inside the DRAFT only (bounded
+        acceptance cost, exact output distribution via rejection sampling)
+        and its `seen` marks feed the background promoter — no draft
+        replay is attempted here.
+        """
+        from vllm.model_executor.layers.quantization.utils import moe_w2_delta
